+// Experimental API.
+// Render-only visibility override ("view state") for OCG |index| (in
+// /OCProperties /OCGs order). It is held by the document handle only: never
+// written to /OCProperties or any other dictionary, so saving (including
+// FPDF_SaveIncrementalObjects) and FPDF_VerifyIncrementalSave are unaffected.
+// It applies to the "View" usage, i.e. every render without FPDF_PRINTING:
